---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Eyebrow from '../components/Eyebrow.astro';
import SlashNav from '../components/SlashNav.astro';
import Sidebar from '../components/Sidebar.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
---
<Base title="About — Kevin's Field Journal">
  <main class="page">
    <article>
      <Eyebrow sub="about · the long version" />
      <h1 class="title">A bit <em>about me</em>.</h1>
      <p class="tagline">The longer answer to "so, what do you do?"</p>
      <SlashNav active="/about" />

      <div class="prose">
        <p>I'm Kevin — a Software Engineer born, raised and based in New York City. I'm currently employed
          as a Data & AI Engineer, where I build and maintain AI-powered data pipelines and infastructure that powers agentic workflows and self-service BI tools.
          I have been programming since I was in middle school and have a background in full stack engineering, although these days I've mostly been focusing on Applied AI engineering.
        </p>

        <p>As a child, I grew up dissasembling, assembling (and inevitably breaking) electronics out of pure curiosity — I was fascinated by technology
           and how it solved meaningful problems and unlocked new possibilities for people. This curiosity eventually led me to discover programming, where I realized
           I could <i>solve</i> meaningful problems in my own life <i>myself</i>!
          This passion for problem solving led me to join as many technology related programs as I could, where I honed my skills and learned with like-minded peers, and ultimately
          culminated in me obtaining a Bachelor of Arts in Computer Science.
        </p>

        <p>
          Now, I focus primarily on Applied AI Engineering opportunities; to be specific, I work and study ways to push the limits of AI agents, making them as efficient, accessible, and useful as possible.
          Most recently, this has led me to explore local/edge computed AI, as it positions itself as the best solution for scaling AI in a cost effective and accessible manner given rising inference costs.
        </p>
        <p>Outside the terminal: I like to read (see <a href="/reading">/reading</a>), enjoy life on the weekends, and share my opinions on life, technology, and society online.
        I used to play a lot of video games but don't have too much time for that these days! </p>
        
        <a href="/contact">contact me here</a>
      </div>
      <div class="divider-label">❦ a small disclaimer</div>
      <p style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--dim); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
        Everything here is my own words and mine alone — not my employer's, not my clients', not anyone else's.
        All opinions expressed are my own and do not reflect the opinions of any current or past employers or clients. 
        I am not a spokesperson for any company, product, or technology.
        Opinions expressed are subject to change without notice as I learn things and grow from mistakes!
      </p>
    </article>

    <Sidebar>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="heading">at a glance</div>
        <div class="body">{profile.location}<br/>Applied AI and Data Engineer · {profile.yearsExp} of professional experience <br/></div>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="heading">currently</div>
        <div class="body" style="color: var(--moss);">● {profile.availability}</div>
        <div>for {profile.targetRoles}</div>
      </div>
      <!-- <div class="block">
        <div class="heading">colophon</div>
        <div>astro + css<br/>no js for content<br/>tended by hand</div>
      </div> -->
    </Sidebar>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .drop-cap {
    float: left;
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 54px;
    line-height: 0.9;
    color: var(--accent);
    padding-right: 8px;
    padding-top: 4px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
